  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Palm & Pearl, where coastal sophistication meets relaxed comfort. This stunning two-story home in beautiful Inlet Beach offers the perfect blend of luxury and livability. With space for up to 16 guests, elegant design, and exceptional amenities—including an outdoor kitchen, community pool, and multiple living areas—Palm & Pearl is your ultimate beachside escape.<br><br>Step into Palm & Pearl, an open and bright Inlet Beach retreat designed for gathering, relaxation, and timeless style. The main level features a spacious living area with a 75” TV and an inviting flow into the large, well-equipped kitchen. A vacationing chef's dream, the kitchen boasts stainless steel appliances, a gas range, and a generous island with seating. <br>The adjoining dining area comfortably seats six to eight, perfect for family meals or lively dinners with friends.<br><br>The main king suite is conveniently located downstairs, offering a peaceful haven with an ensuite bath and direct access to the covered patio. Upstairs, you'll find three additional king bedrooms, each featuring a private ensuite bathroom, ceiling fan, and TV—ideal for guests seeking comfort and privacy.<br><br>The second living area upstairs is a versatile retreat of its own, with two queen bunk beds, two full bunk beds, a cozy lounge space with seating, a bar area, and a half bath. Step outside to the expansive covered deck, where entertaining meets coastal leisure. <br><br>The outdoor kitchen includes a built-in grill, fridge, and ice maker, along with a dining table for four, comfortable seating, and a TV—perfect for enjoying the coastal breeze or catching a game.<br><br>Whether gathering indoors or relaxing under the stars, Palm & Pearl offers the perfect setting for memorable beach vacations with family and friends.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>\t•\tBedroom 1 (Main Level): King bed, ceiling fan, TV, ensuite bath, access to covered patio<br>\t•\tBedroom 2 (Upstairs): King bed, ceiling fan, TV, ensuite bath<br>\t•\tBedroom 3 (Upstairs): King bed, ceiling fan, TV, ensuite bath<br>\t•\tBedroom 4 (Upstairs): King bed, ceiling fan, TV, ensuite bath<br>\t•\tBedroom 5 (Upstairs – Second Living Area): 2 queen bunks, 2 full bunks, bar area, half bath, access to balcony and covered deck with outdoor kitchen<br><br>Located close to Palm and Pearl: <br><br>Upscale Dining<br>\t•\tCuvee 30A – Fine dining with coastal cuisine, steaks, and an extensive wine list.<br>\t•\tamici 30A Italian Kitchen – Stylish Italian restaurant with wood-fired pizzas and fresh pastas.<br>\t•\tamigos 30A Mexican Kitchen – Sister restaurant to amici, offering upscale Mexican fare and craft cocktails.<br>\t•\tThe Citizen (Alys Beach) – Modern coastal cuisine in an elegant setting, great for a special night out.<br>\t•\tPescado (Rosemary Beach) – Rooftop dining with Gulf views, seafood, and craft cocktails.<br><br>Casual & Family-Friendly<br>\t•\tShades Bar & Grill – Local favorite for burgers, seafood, and sports in a lively atmosphere.<br>\t•\tBig Bad Breakfast – Southern-style breakfast and brunch, ideal for groups.<br>\t•\tThe Donut Hole – Classic breakfast and comfort food spot loved by locals.<br>\t•\t30A Burger – Easygoing option for burgers, salads, and shakes.<br>\t•\tCowgirl Kitchen (Rosemary Beach) – Coastal Tex-Mex with a laid-back vibe.<br><br>Seafood & Coastal Favorites<br>\t•\tBack Beach Barbecue – Great for smoked meats, ribs, and pulled pork close to the beach.<br>\t•\tGeorge's at Alys Beach – Upscale coastal dishes with Southern flair in a charming cottage setting.<br>\t•\tParadis (Rosemary Beach) – Intimate seafood and steak restaurant with an excellent wine selection.<br>\t•\tHook'd Pier Bar & Grill – Beachfront seafood and casual drinks with a view.<br><br>Quick Bites & Cafés<br>\t•\tRaw & Juicy (Alys Beach) – Smoothies, juices, and healthy bites in a beautiful open-air setting.<br>\t•\tSummer Kitchen Café (Rosemary Beach) – Breakfast, lunch, and dinner with a beachy, casual vibe.<br>\t•\tCafe Thirty-A (Seagrove Beach) – Casual fine dining, a 30A classic known for great seafood and martinis.<br><br>Things to do close to Palm and Pearl: <br><br>Local Towns & Beach Communities:<br><br>Inlet Beach – Known for its wide beaches, clear waters, and laid-back charm. Offers a mix of boutique shopping, dining, and outdoor activities.<br><br>Rosemary Beach – Upscale European-inspired community with cobblestone streets, fine dining, boutique shops, and a beautiful beach.<br><br>Alys Beach – Elegant white architecture, luxury restaurants, and a sophisticated, serene atmosphere perfect for strolling or dining out.<br><br>Seagrove Beach – A classic 30A destination with casual eateries, bike rentals, and beach access surrounded by nature.<br><br>Seaside – Iconic 30A town known for its pastel cottages, outdoor amphitheater, food trucks, and charming central square.<br><br>Grayton Beach – Eclectic and artsy coastal village featuring Grayton Beach State Park, local art galleries, and the famous Red Bar.<br><br>WaterColor – Coastal-chic town with scenic walking paths, lakeside views, and upscale dining options.<br><br>Santa Rosa Beach – Larger beach community offering nature trails, local restaurants, and access to several coastal dune lakes.<br><br>Panama City Beach – Just a short drive east, offering family attractions, nightlife, shopping at Pier Park, and beachside entertainment.<br><br>Popular Attractions<br>\t•\tCamp Helen State Park – Beachfront park offering swimming, kayaking, and hiking.<br>\t•\tLake Powell – Perfect for paddleboarding, fishing, and kayaking.<br>\t•\tPier Park – Large outdoor shopping and entertainment center with restaurants, rides, and events.<br>\t•\t30Avenue – Upscale shopping and dining complex near Inlet Beach.<br>\t•\tThe HUB 30A – Family-friendly gathering spot with live music, dining, and outdoor movies.<br>\t•\tEden Gardens State Park – Historic gardens and home surrounded by centuries-old oak trees.<br>\t•\tGulf World Marine Park – Marine life exhibits and dolphin encounters in Panama City Beach.<br>\t•\tShipwreck Island Waterpark – Seasonal family waterpark with slides and a lazy river.<br>\t•\tGrayton Beach State Park – Nationally ranked beach with trails and a coastal dune lake.<br>\t•\tTopsail Hill Preserve State Park – Hiking, fishing, and stunning dune lake views.<br><br>Enjoy this beautiful home, and the community pool.<br><br>Please feel free to reach out to us - our team is always happy to help!<br><br>Community Pool",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
